{"meta":{"id":"request-param","category":"it/syntax/spring/controller","title":"값 받기 · null 처리 (@RequestParam) · Spring","subtitle":"(SPRING)","summary":"getParameter 직접 null 처리, @RequestParam name · required · defaultValue","tags":["spring","f-network","f-null","f-web-scope"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">값 받기 · null 처리 (@RequestParam) · Spring</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> getParameter 직접 null 처리, @RequestParam name · required · defaultValue</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">request.getParameter — 직접 null 처리</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/주소&quot;, method = RequestMethod.POST)\r\npublic String home(Model model, HttpServletRequest request) {\r\n    int age = request.getParameter(&quot;age&quot;) == null ? 0 : Integer.parseInt(request.getParameter(&quot;age&quot;));\r\n    request.setAttribute(&quot;age&quot;, age);\r\n    return &quot;주소&quot;;\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">@RequestParam — 이름 · 기본값 · 필수 여부</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public String a(@RequestParam(name = &quot;mid&quot;, defaultValue = &quot;&quot;, required = false) String mid) { }\r\npublic String b(@RequestParam(name = &quot;age&quot;, defaultValue = &quot;0&quot;) int age) { }   // Spring 이 int 로 변환\r\n\r\n// 같은 의미\r\npublic String c(@RequestParam(&quot;mid&quot;) String mid) { }        // name 만 쓸 때는 생략 가능\r\npublic String d(@RequestParam(name = &quot;mid&quot;) String mid) { }\r\n\r\n// 오류\r\npublic String e(@RequestParam(name = &quot;age&quot;) int age) { }     // 값이 없으면 null → int 변환 오류</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">정리</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">속성</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>name (value)</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">받을 파라미터 이름 — 받은 값을 매개변수에 넣어 준다</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>required</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">기본 true (필수). false 면 없어도 됨 → null</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>defaultValue</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">값이 없을 때 사용할 값. 지정하면 required 를 안 써도 오류 없음</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">int 처럼 형 변환이 필요한 기본형은 defaultValue 를 꼭 지정한다</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › null 처리 (??), Java › Optional</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/spring/controller/request-param","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"spring","title":"SPRING","path":"it/syntax/spring"},{"id":"controller","title":"컨트롤러 · 데이터 통신","path":"it/syntax/spring/controller"}],"hasImage":false}